WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.892 --> 00:00:04.809
(people talking in background)

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.917
- Oh, shit!

00:00:08.562 --> 00:00:11.324
- (scoffs) Hi, are you okay?

00:00:11.324 --> 00:00:12.886
- Just pretend I'm not even here.

00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:13.803
- Oh, okay.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:19.103
Sorry, I'm just very aware of
how close you are to my bum.

00:00:19.103 --> 00:00:20.686
Is this a game I don't know about?

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.198
Oh, is this planking?

00:00:22.198 --> 00:00:24.381
- No, no, I'm hiding.

00:00:24.381 --> 00:00:25.469
- From an ex?

00:00:25.469 --> 00:00:26.532
- Technically.

00:00:26.532 --> 00:00:28.524
More like an ex-roommate?

00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:32.107
(soft piano music playing)

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.693
- Hey, are you June?

00:00:39.693 --> 00:00:40.526
- Yeah.

00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:44.842
- Tiffany wants you to
have your stuff back.

00:00:44.842 --> 00:00:47.388
- What, she couldn't face me herself?

00:00:47.388 --> 00:00:48.471
- She's busy.

00:00:51.605 --> 00:00:53.529
(soft piano music playing)

00:00:53.529 --> 00:00:56.446
(keyboard tapping)

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:10.372
- (gasping) Tiffany's travel mug.

00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:12.498
(gasping) Her pen!

00:01:12.498 --> 00:01:14.909
Her hair tie, oh, this is mine.

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:16.764
(girls talking softly)

00:01:16.764 --> 00:01:18.495
Hey, Tiffany.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:21.017
- Hey June, this is my
new roommate, Lilly.

00:01:21.017 --> 00:01:22.266
- Hey, what's up?

00:01:22.266 --> 00:01:23.099
- New roommate.

00:01:23.099 --> 00:01:23.932
- Yeah.

00:01:25.538 --> 00:01:26.671
- Cool.

00:01:26.671 --> 00:01:30.798
"Oh, I'm Lilly, I like to party
and have fun all the time."

00:01:30.798 --> 00:01:34.235
You're gonna get sick of her! (sobbing)

00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:38.402
(soft piano music playing)
(rain falling)

00:01:39.306 --> 00:01:40.179
- Wow.

00:01:40.179 --> 00:01:42.475
Was she really that good of a roommate?

00:01:42.475 --> 00:01:43.309
- No.

00:01:43.309 --> 00:01:44.942
But you know, nobody likes change.

00:01:44.942 --> 00:01:46.906
- Oh, hey June.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.156
- Hey, Tiffany.

00:01:49.723 --> 00:01:50.934
Oh, this is, uh--

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:52.786
- Bridget, Junes's new roommate.

00:01:52.786 --> 00:01:54.686
- Oh, really.

00:01:54.686 --> 00:01:56.296
- Yeah, she's loads of fun.

00:01:56.296 --> 00:01:58.424
I haven't stopped laughing
since I moved in. (giggles)

00:01:58.424 --> 00:01:59.591
- Yeah, I bet.

00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:02.965
- Well, it's Roommates
Day Out, right, June?

00:02:02.965 --> 00:02:03.798
Must go.
- Yeah.

00:02:03.798 --> 00:02:05.219
- Nice to meet you, Theresa.

00:02:05.219 --> 00:02:06.886
- But, it's Tiffany!

00:02:08.084 --> 00:02:10.255
- Oh my god, thank you so much.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:11.830
- Honestly, don't mention it.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.894
- You don't even know
how much you helped me.

00:02:13.894 --> 00:02:16.205
- Oh, shit, I'm late for Psych class.

00:02:16.205 --> 00:02:17.552
It was so lovely running into you.

00:02:17.552 --> 00:02:19.219
I'll see you around.

00:02:21.731 --> 00:02:23.343
- Oh, shit.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:27.176
(uptempo instrumental music)

